## Test & validation scaffolding (build before the feature)

Before serious implementation, establish how the project will be tested:

- [ ] Unit tests framework
- [ ] Linter / formatter
- [ ] Production build / typecheck
- [ ] Smoke tests / screenshots / real target-environment check

If the agent cannot tell whether a change worked, more code only creates more
uncertainty.
